# A BARE `.env` WAS NOT IGNORED. back/.env holds a live OPENAI_API_KEY and sat untracked
# but committable — one `git add -A` from being pushed to a remote. The `*.env.*` rule above
# only covers suffixed files (.env.development, .env.production), never `.env` itself.
.env
